# Spacing grid 8 + 4

- One Tailwind spacing step = 4px. **Layout scope** (`packages/blocks/**`, `packages/adapter/src/blocks.generated.css`, `base.css`, `apps/**`): even steps only — the Habitus rhythm `0 2 4 6 8 10 12 16 20 24 28` (`28` = 112px section gap, Figma 110). The policy is the codegen 2.0 grid (`packages/ui/.xgen/.ui8px/policy/allowed.json`: every 8px step 0–160) narrowed to this rhythm in `tools/ui8px/allowed.base.json`; `tools/ui8px-policy.ts` fails if a rhythm step leaves the 2.0 grid.
- **Control scope** (`packages/ui/**`, `packages/icons/**`, `primitives.generated.css`): also 4px steps `1 3 5 7` for dense controls; heights `h-8 / h-10 / h-12` are the 2.0 shared control scale, `h-14` is the Habitus `xl` button (Figma 56–58px).
- No fractional steps (codegen 2.0 recipes have none; the `spacing` gate of xgen check fails on `x.5`), no arbitrary values (`p-[13px]`, `grid-cols-[…]`).
- Figma values are snapped to the nearest grid step; record a deliberate deviation in `.project/backlog/`.
- Verify: `bun tools/ui8px-gate.ts` → `blocking 0` (part of `bun run check`). New utilities go through review in `tools/ui8px/allowed.extra.json`, then `bun tools/ui8px-policy.ts`.
